oken. When `StopAsync` completes, then the marker file is removed.","area":"MCP","title":"Test TEST-MCP-013","status":"pending","createdAt":"2026-10-12T00:52:21.9063209+00:00","id":"TEST-MCP-013","testType":"unit","scopeStartLayerKey":"layer-1"},{"acceptanceCriteria":[],"priority":"medium","updatedAt":"2026-10-12T00:52:21.9067162+00:00","description":"Given a TODO item with a title and description, when `RequirementsService.AnalyzeAsync` is called, then `ExtractRequirementIds` correctly parses both JSON-block and regex-fallback response formats and returns distinct, non-empty FR/TR ID lists.","area":"MCP","title":"Test TEST-MCP-014","status":"pending","createdAt":"2026-10-12T00:52:21.9066842+00:00","id":"TEST-MCP-014","testType":"unit","scopeStartLayerKey":"layer-1"},{"acceptanceCriteria":[],"priority":"medium","updatedAt":"2026-10-12T00:52:21.9070893+00:00","description":"Given a Markdown file with a `# Session Log - {title}` header, when `MarkdownSessionLogParser.TryParse` is called, then it returns a `UnifiedSessionLogDto` with matching title, model, status, and at least one entry. Given a file without the header, then `TryParse` returns null.","area":"MCP","title":"Test TEST-MCP-015","status":"pending","createdAt":"2026-10-12T00:52:21.9070579+00:00","id":"TEST-MCP-015","testType":"unit","scopeStartLayerKey":"layer-1"},{"acceptanceCriteria":[],"priority":"medium","updatedAt":"2026-10-12T00:52:21.9074043+00:00","description":"Given a CQRS Dispatcher with a registered command handler, when `SendAsync` is called with a valid command, then the handler is invoked and `Result<T>.IsSuccess` is true with the expected value.","area":"MCP","title":"Test TEST-MCP-026","status":"pending","createdAt":"2026-10-12T00:52:21.9073774+00:00","id":"TEST-MCP-026","testType":"unit","scopeStartLayerKey":"layer-1"},{"acceptanceCriteria":[],"priority":"medium","updatedAt":"2026-10-12T00:52:21.9076767+00:00","description":"Given a CQRS command handler that returns `Result.Failure(error)`,