    "  - `mcpserver-codex-plugin`: remote `main` `ce4a7a64`; local detached at `b776df5`, 11 uncommitted files, 1.108.0, hook `26137529`. Registers no hooks today (no `hooks/hooks.json`, no manifest `hooks`); turn logging is manual through `skills/enforcement/SKILL.md:12-69`, so P0.2 observes Codex's own hook behavior in a temporary isolated probe home (P0.2 (c)), not through this plugin. Pester + bats.",
