    "  - `mcpserver-grok-plugin`: remote `main` `24a9a933`; local detached at `a527ffc`, 14 uncommitted files, 1.108.0, hook `26137529`. Claude-compatible hook set; Grok sends camelCase payloads (`sessionId`, `promptId`, `toolUseId`, `stopHookActive`, `subagentType`), so the core's snake_case reads come back empty; Grok also runs the hooks in `~/.claude/settings.json` by default. Pester + bats.",
    "  - `mcpserver-grok-bot-plugin`: added 2026-10-09 (operator D8; listed in Codex NOTICE PROD-QBRAIN-AI, `MEMORY-PROCESS-007` 17:48:48Z). Remote default `main` `99fcee9`; local on `main` at `99fcee9`, 2 uncommitted files (`.gitignore` modified, `docs/wiki.yaml` untracked), 1.118.0. A fork of the Claude plugin for Grok Bot cloud instances (`.grok-plugin/plugin.json`: \"Connect Grok Bot cloud instances to McpServer\"), same hook set as Claude Code (SessionStart, SessionEnd, PreCompact, PostCompact, UserPromptSubmit, Stop, PostToolUse) and a `CORE-MANIFEST.yaml:14` that declares `lib/plugin-hook.ps1` SHA-256 `e4cd6116` while the file itself hashes to `d917feb6` (drift resolved by the A9 sync). Not yet listed in `build/Build.SyncAgentPlugins.cs:19-28`; A9 adds it there. Pester (`tests/*.Tests.ps1`) + bats (`tests/*.bats`).",
    "- TypeScript hosts (consume the Node plugin core `plugins/core/lib-node`, built and packed by `SyncAgentPlugins` via `npm run build` + `npm pack`, `build/Build.SyncAgentPlugins.cs:522-559`):",
